  "interpretation": [
    "Fully frozen output has no independent temporal pixel variation in the measured ROIs.",
    "Normal burning retains flame, shade motion and particles. The final core varies these together, so it does not isolate their separate causal shares.",
    "The projected flame-position ROI may include translucent cloth/ribs and background; it is not a pure flame mask.",
    "Rectangular regions labelled structure are not semantic masks; images must be used to judge crossings/coverage.",
    "Statistics use raw framebuffer luminance code values, not video decoding or linear scene radiance. Capture readback/video timing is not the separate no-video frame-budget measurement."
